OL,3,GNEWSASlimmer named Woman of the Year
OL,4,Aafter losing 13st
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I didn't want to spend the day hiding
OL,7,Ffrom the camera or standing in the
OL,8,Fbackground."
OL,10,FAt her heaviest, Kay Lake weighed 24st
OL,11,F1lb (153kg), but the turning point came
OL,12,Fwhen her daughter booked the date for
OL,13,Fher wedding, and she went on to lose
OL,14,F13st 5.5lbs (85kg) - more than half her
OL,15,Fbody weight.
OL,17,FThe 53-year-old, from Bilston, has been
OL,18,Fnamed Slimming World's Woman of the
OL,19,FYear.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
