OL,3,GNEWSASlimmer named Woman of the Year
OL,4,Aafter losing 13st
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I wanted to be a fully present
OL,7,Fmother-of-the-bride in a gorgeous
OL,8,Foutfit, making memories with my
OL,9,Fdaughter and enjoying every moment,"
OL,10,Fshe said.
